:22.800">to </span><span begin="01:22.800" end="01:23.220">holler </span><span begin="01:23.220" end="01:23.430">at </span><span begin="01:23.430" end="01:25.650">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.240" end="01:33.540"><span begin="01:27.240" end="01:27.690">Trying </span><span begin="01:27.690" end="01:27.990">to </span><span begin="01:27.990" end="01:28.410">holler </span><span begin="01:28.410" end="01:28.650">at </span><span begin="01:28.650" end="01:30.630">me</span><span begin="01:30.630" end="01:30.960">,</span><span begin="01:30.960" end="01:31.200">at </span><span begin="01:31.200" end="01:33.510">me</span><span begin="01:33.510" end="01:33.540">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.540" end="01:36.240"><span begin="01:33.540" end="01:33.750">But </span><span begin="01:33.750" end="01:33.810">a </span><span begin="01:33.810" end="01:34.230">scrub's </span><span begin="01:34.230" end="01:34.560">checkin' </span><span begin="01:34.560" end="01:34.920">me </span><span begin="01:34.920" end="01:35.070">and </span><span begin="01:35.070" end="01:35.190">his </span><span begin="01:35.190" end="01:35.400">gime </span><span begin="01:35.400" end="01:35.520">is </span><span begin="01:35.520" end="01:35.850">kinda </span><span begin="01:35.850" end="01:36.240">weak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.240" end="01:38.760"><span begin="01:36.240" end="01:36.420">And </span><span begin="01:36.420" end="01:36.480">I </span><span begin="01:36.480" end="01:36.840">know </span><span begin="01:36.840" end="01:37.050">that </span><span begin="01:37.050" end="01:37.140">he </span><span begin="01:37.140" end="01:37.740">cannot </span><span begin="01:37.740" end="01:38.370">approach </span><span begin="01:38.370" end="01:38.760">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.790" end="01:41.400"><span begin="01:38.790" end="01:38.970">Cause </span><span begin="01:38.970" end="01:39.060">I'm </span><span begin="01:39.060" end="01:39.390">looking </span><span begin